    {
      "text": "Predefined applications are available for ZDX when you log in. The predefined applications provide quick and seamless application onboarding for admins."
    },
    {
      "text": "To find the list of predefined applications in the Zscaler Admin Console, from the navigation menu, go to Digital Experience > Settings & Configurations > Probes > End User > Predefined Apps Collection.",
