    {
      "text": "The Microsoft 365 subscription and Advanced subscription both support Unified Communications as a Service (UCaaS) voice monitoring. However, only Microsoft Teams Call Quality is currently supported for the Microsoft 365 subscription."
    },
    {
      "text": "To learn more about predefined applications, see About Applications and Configuring a Predefined Application."
    },
    {
      "text": "To learn more about ZDX features unique to each ZDX subscription, see Ranges & Limitations."
